OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh's Castle of Light event
OL,4,Acancelled after six years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA huge light show which has run at
OL,7,FEdinburgh Castle for six years has been
OL,8,Fcancelled, it has been announced.
OL,10,FThe Castle of Light event has been held
OL,11,Fover the festive period since 2019 and
OL,12,Fhas brought in more than 200,000
OL,13,Fvisitors, according to Historic
OL,14,FEnvironment Scotland (HES).
OL,16,FIt said the event required a lot of
OL,17,Fplanning and money and was also highly
OL,18,Fweather-dependent with high winds and
OL,19,Fstorms causing cancellations in
OL,20,Fprevious years.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
