OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh's Castle of Light event
OL,4,Acancelled after six years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers said all these factors
OL,7,Fcombined meant it was no longer
OL,8,Fsustainable for them to run the event.
